{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14231200","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14231200","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1423120001:0":{"text":"親分、何かご用ですかい？","source_cn":"铁须老大，您怎么来了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1BA08B53703CC6F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423120002:1":{"text":"やることあるならすぐ動きますよ、ほら、この通り！","source_cn":"有什么活要俺们干的吗？俺们手脚麻利得很！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x282C5D6BC1B9E03B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1423120003:1":{"text":"そうかい、いつもその調子ならいいんだけどね。","source_cn":"你现在干活倒是积极起来了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC63AEB9C39845FA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423120004:1":{"text":"そりゃあ、俺たちはハガルド親分の弟子だからな！","source_cn":"毕竟俺们正式加入铁须老大这边了嘛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA0690A0E50E58C26","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1423120005:1":{"text":"今は、お前らの出る幕じゃない。","source_cn":"现在还用不着你们动手干活。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6EC44D77195FA44","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1423120006:1":{"text":"これから見せてもらうもん